    "sentence_translations": [
      "300 and 30,000",
      "",
      "A man in Shenzhen saw a charity program online and wanted to donate 300 yuan to show his compassion.",
      "However, he mistook the decimal point and wrote 30,000 instead of 300, and suddenly donated 30,000 yuan.",
      "He panicked and contacted the foundation behind the program to get his money back, but was refused.",
      "The foundation said that the money had already been contributed and could not be taken back.",
      "However, when someone took a closer look at this foundation they found that it might be fake.",
      "",
      "When this came out, netizens started to comment one after another: I'm really disappointed!",
      "I'll never dare to donate to someone I don't know again!",
      "Sometimes indifference towards others is really forced out of people.",
      ""
    ]
